# Local dev's SQLite thread-ownership DB (lib/db/client.ts's default dbPath()
# under ./.data). Never bake a developer's local runtime state into the image
# — real deploys always set PORTAL_DB_PATH to the PVC path (/data/portal.db),
# which lives outside the build context entirely. Without this, `COPY . .`
# picks up whatever happens to be at ./.data on the host at build time.
